# Fights for physics timing (Bullet debris): from a save with the sword at full
# life, out to the rabbit field east of the castle, then swing in every
# direction for ~30 s -- sword beams, kills, debris. Needs a save past the
# sword; seed it with SAVES=. tests/phys_frames.py reads the PS3_FTRACE file.
log TitleMovie 120
sleep 5
press START
sleep 3
press START
sleep 5
press CROSS
sleep 15
hold RIGHT 4
hold DOWN 1.5
hold RIGHT 3
hold UP 5
shot field

hold RIGHT 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold DOWN 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold LEFT 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold UP 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold RIGHT 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold DOWN 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold LEFT 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold UP 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold RIGHT 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold DOWN 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold LEFT 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold UP 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold RIGHT 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold DOWN 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold LEFT 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold UP 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold RIGHT 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold DOWN 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold LEFT 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold UP 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold RIGHT 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold DOWN 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold LEFT 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold UP 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold RIGHT 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold DOWN 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold LEFT 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold UP 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold RIGHT 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold DOWN 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold LEFT 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
hold UP 0.15
repeat 2 CROSS 0.35
shot end
sleep 10
